{"version":1,"content":"\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1024\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20261029%E5%BA%AD%E5%88%8A%EF%BD%9C%E9%87%8D%E9%BB%9E%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E9%80%9F%E8%A6%BD_01-1024x1024.png\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p>\n<p><a href=\"https://linktr.ee/hkcourtnews\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">訂閱《庭刊》</a></p>\n</p>\n<p>🔸高等法院<br/>► 1000　10庭　暫委法官祁彥輝<br/>蔡天鳳碎屍案　前夫、家翁及大伯被控謀殺等罪｜續審</p>\n<p>🔸區域法院<br/>► 1000　36庭　法官張潔宜<br/>時事評論員王岸然被控違反「23條」｜續審</p>\n<p>🔸西九龍法院<br/>► 1500　3庭　總裁判官蘇惠德<br/>宏福苑五級火　「宏業」、「鴻毅」及公司董事等7人被控誤殺等罪｜再提堂</p>\n<p>🔸東區法院<br/>► 0930　1庭　總裁判官蘇惠德<br/>舞台劇《關於那隻龜回魂的故事》演出期間　觀眾席上男子涉襲擊女子｜答辯<br/>► 1030　15庭　暫委裁判官莊靜敏<br/>「人人和平」被指阻塞逃生途徑遭票控｜再提堂</p>\n<p>🔸觀塘法院<br/>► 0930　1庭　署理主任裁判官李志豪<br/>無業男國慶前後藍田毀慶國慶旗幟｜再提堂</p>\n<p>🔸屯門法院<br/>► 0930　1庭　裁判官覃有方<br/>元朗狗咬狗　大狗狗主被控兩罪｜再提堂<br/>「520浪浪加油站」負責人涉殘酷對待貓狗及誤導警方｜再提堂</p>\n<p>🔸九龍城法院<br/>► 1430　1庭　署理主任裁判官鄭念慈<br/>醫療輔助隊總參事黃英強涉非禮女子｜審前覆核</p>\n<hr/>\n<p>「重點法庭案件速覽」是根據法庭日誌內，我們認為大眾會關注的翌日案件，選取出來以方便讀者閱覽</p>\n<figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://qr.payme.hsbc.com.hk/2/QrndvPxDgEi2MhNiNPz4b8\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"916\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/%E5%BA%AD%E5%88%8A%EF%BD%9CHKCourtNews_PayMe_QR_code.png\" width=\"716\"/></a></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1080\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/hkcourtnews_Octopus_QRcode_Payment_v4.png\" width=\"1080\"/></figure>\n</figure>\n<p><strong>如欲接收每日報道整合，請在訊息欄內填寫電郵地址</strong></p>\n<p></p>\n","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T13:21:41.791545+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":500,"images":3,"source":"法庭線","fallback":"rss-http-error","origin":"wordpress-public-posts","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T12:47:52+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T12:18:16.856741+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T13:18:21.938327+00:00","content_hash":"09fb4aa06baac0822775a7951b807637b32180bb8d688d9059be68b231fdf199","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 520","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}